classDiagram
    class GiModel {
        -Dictionary database
        +String LastProduct
        +int CurrentGi
        +event OnDataChanged
        +event OnError
        +SearchProduct(String name)
    }

    class GiController {
        -GiModel model
        +GiController(GiModel model)
        +HandleSearch(String productName)
    }

    class MainForm {
        -GiModel model
        -GiController controller
        +MainForm()
        -btnOpenInput_Click()
    }

    class InputForm {
        -TextBox txtProduct
        +String EnteredProduct
        +InputForm(String previousInput)
        -btnOk_Click()
    }

    MainForm --> GiModel : Подписка на события
    MainForm --> GiController : Использование
    GiController --> GiModel : Вызов методов
    MainForm ..> InputForm : Создает окно